Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.58,0:01:58.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry. Can you help me? My tyre...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.71,0:02:02.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I have an appointment. I don't like to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.25,0:02:05.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, would you rather be late or dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.79,0:02:10.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You don't want to do this. - Step out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.58,0:02:19.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoo! Let's go, fellas!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.96,0:02:23.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, baby! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:25.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take it easy. The car's brand-new.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.71,0:02:31.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No problem, buddy. I got this. - Baby, let's ride. Time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.08,0:02:35.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Your parents know the company you keep? - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:37.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- This shit ain't working. - It's coded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.87,0:02:39.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's the code? - I can't give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:43.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll have to beat it out of you. Get out the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:46.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, man. What you got for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.71,0:02:49.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.04,0:02:52.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.29,0:02:55.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,It just came out of the dry cleaner's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.71,0:03:19.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hands up. Stop moving or I will shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.71,0:03:22.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't you have homework to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.33,0:03:27.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Why don't you go and do it? - OK. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:34.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.87,0:04:45.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.17,0:04:50.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The game, the game, the game! - What's the first rule on entering a man's car?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:54.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Respect a man's car, a man respects you. - Rule number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:59.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Greet the man. Good afternoon, Frank. - Good afternoon, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:03.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can we play the game? - I should think you'd be tired after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.33,0:05:07.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're afraid I'm gonna win. - You'll be too worn out to do your homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.29,0:05:11.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's Friday. I don't have any homework. - In that case, the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.50,0:05:16.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes! - But first, what's the third rule of the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:17.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:38.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Five points. I'm white, I'm round, but I'm not always around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:42.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- A tennis ball? - Tennis balls are yellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:57.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Four points.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:06:01.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I'm half, sometimes whole. Sometimes a slice is all you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.17,0:06:03.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- A loaf of bread? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.67,0:06:12.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Three points. Sometimes I'm light, sometimes dark. Sometimes I'm both.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:14.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I know. A light buIb. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:17.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- A pizza! - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:21.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Audrey. Audrey! Stop walking away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:25.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen, we've got to finish this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.79,0:07:29.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.17,0:07:35.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, look at me. Last clue for all the points.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.79,0:07:40.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everyone wants to walk on me, but only a happy few ever have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.50,0:07:42.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:54.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, bud. - Shh! Mom, it's the game. I'm trying to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.12,0:07:57.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sorry. Hey, Frank. How are you today? - Well, Mrs Billings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:01.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can I team up with Mom? - I don't know. It's not in the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.67,0:08:05.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. What's the point in having rules if you can't bend 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:08.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- OK. Just this once. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.58,0:08:11.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Give me some clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.46,0:08:17.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's round, but not always around. It's light sometimes, dark sometimes, or both.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.17,0:08:21.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everyone wants to walk on it, but only a happy few ever have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:25.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That is a hard one. - Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.67,0:08:31.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The moon! - Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.54,0:08:33.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good job. All right. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.92,0:08:36.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- See you Monday. - Bye, Frank. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:39.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Keep your snacks in the kitchen. - Bye, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:42.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's really taken to you in the month you've been with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.33,0:08:46.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Likewise. - Too bad you can't stay on when Tony's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:49.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was just a favour. I don't usually do this sort of ajob.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:53.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a professional driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.25,0:08:55.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,A different kind of driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:09:01.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, we're all gonna miss you when you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:09.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:12.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,thank you for what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.75,0:09:15.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:19.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,For turning the car around so that Jack wouldn't have to see us fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:23.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You really know kids, don't you? - I know fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:26.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,He hasn't seen Jack in months,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:29.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,and when he gets back, all I hear is what I'm doing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:35.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'd think that after being separated for a year that he would...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.46,0:09:40.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. You don't have to hear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:46.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's OK. For what it's worth, I think you're doing a greatjob with Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:47.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.83,0:09:50.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Any time I can be of help, if there's anything you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.92,0:09:53.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's really sweet of you, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.04,0:09:56.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,I might have to take you up on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:05.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot. I'm supposed to take Jack to the doctor tomorrow morning for a checkup,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.21,0:10:10.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,but I'm organising a party for him, even though his birthday's not until next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.79,0:10:18.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, while I decorate and his friends arrive, I was thinking, if you wouldn't mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.62,0:10:21.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'll take him. - I feel funny cutting into your weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.96,0:10:25.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just picking up a friend at the airport later on in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:27.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's nice. - What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:31.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,The guys on security say you're a bit of a loner. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:35.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- So it's just nice to hear you have a friend. - He's not really a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.00,0:10:38.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's French.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.37,0:10:41.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:44.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Audrey. I'd like to finish our conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.67,0:10:52.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,If anything comes up before then, you have my cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.79,0:10:57.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Nothing will come up, Mrs Billings. - Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.08,0:10:58.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.71,0:11:31.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, hello? - Confirmed for tomorrow. 9am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.17,0:12:24.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, 9:00 am. Only change, the driver'll be taking him, not the mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.21,0:12:25.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.87,0:12:34.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Vasily?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.75,0:12:47.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is it stable? - Yes, it's stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:49.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,And the antidote?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:12:59.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.00,0:13:14.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,The drug-enforcement ministers of six Latin American countries
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.71,0:13:16.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,arrived in Miami for a summit meeting...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:20.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Martin, Frank. 1156 Palmeadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.58,0:13:25.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for an express delivery. That's what you told me 45 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.75,0:13:29.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't need anything else. Just the pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.83,0:13:32.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm not paying for that... - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:34.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.83,0:13:40.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, it's one medium pie, no mozzarella, extra olives and extra anchovies,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:42.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,which amounts to $11.95.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:45.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I hope you're hungry. - You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.75,0:13:49.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I apologise for the delay, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.42,0:13:52.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mrs Billings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.46,0:13:57.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Audrey. Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.25,0:14:01.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing? - What does it look like I'm doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.87,0:14:06.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Have you been drinking? - A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.96,0:14:11.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,You said if I needed anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.17,0:14:15.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I can't. - Why? Because of who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:19.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because of who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.67,0:14:32.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,I feel so lost. So confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.87,0:14:36.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who isn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:48.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:52.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,For the time and...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:55.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,your respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.42,0:14:58.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think it's what I needed the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:02.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:37.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Am I gonna get a shot? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.21,0:16:05.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Jeez. We're not open yet. - I need to see the doctor immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.21,0:16:09.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right. Dr Koblin, if you'll come out here, please. We have an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.75,0:16:12.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll have to state the medical problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.33,0:16:17.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Actually, my problem's not medical. It's psychological.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.79,0:16:20.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, Laura. What seems to be the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.46,0:16:22.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.67,0:16:25.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hate shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.21,0:16:29.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Number one, there's no guarantee you're getting a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.25,0:16:33.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's no sense getting worked up over something that might not happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:41.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Give me the news. - Doctor said I'm cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.67,0:16:46.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Frank, it hurts a lot. - I'd never let anyone hurt you a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.87,0:16:49.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Promise? - You know my fourth rule?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:54.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Never make a promise you can't keep. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.17,0:16:58.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Close the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.87,0:17:08.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:17.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- May I help you? - Jack Billings to see Dr Koblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:20.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's out sick today. He'll be seeing Dr Tyberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.75,0:17:24.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I like Dr Koblin. - Don't worry. Dr Tyberg's very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.00,0:17:27.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just take him into room 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:29.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where's Laura? - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:32.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're standing at her desk. - That Laura. She's out sick too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:37.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of flu going around. Now, come on. Doctor's got a busy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.21,0:17:40.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. It'll be over before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.92,0:17:43.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.67,0:17:47.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm Dr Tyberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.33,0:17:49.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't I wait for my doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:52.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your doctor was called away on an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.87,0:17:56.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The nurse said he had the flu. - That was the emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.08,0:18:02.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,He came down with flu, very quickly. So, the sooner we start, the sooner we finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.71,0:18:06.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come. I show you something very cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:09.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Doctor-patient privacy in room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:13.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can wait in reception area, or glass of water, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.33,0:18:17.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, trust me. I am doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.75,0:18:19.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please. It's phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:27.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah? - All? all? Frank? I am here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.12,0:18:30.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're early. - Yeah, we had fantastic tailwinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.12,0:18:32.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Put two hours on my vacation, just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:36.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,From now on, it's the only way I'm flying. Tailwinds or nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.92,0:18:39.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Glad you made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.29,0:18:46.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello. Sorry, Dr Dunietz is not in today. Call back Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.17,0:18:56.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm a little tied up. You mind taking a cab? You have the address, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.17,0:19:02.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you. I heard the fish down here is fantastic. I could make us a bouillabaisse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.29,0:19:05.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,You like bouillabaisse, Frank, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:08.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.46,0:19:09.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Frank!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.71,0:19:12.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe we'll wait for his regular doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:15.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's important that he receives immunisations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.29,0:19:19.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm sure. But a week won't make a difference. - No, we're doing it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.50,0:19:43.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get going, Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.96,0:20:56.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at me. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:21:00.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Remember my promise? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.62,0:21:22.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's... It's me! - Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.21,0:21:29.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.83,0:22:00.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.00,0:22:13.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,The patient's not cooperating. Prep the vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.87,0:22:29.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.17,0:22:35.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Everything's gonna be OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.42,0:23:07.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Freeze! Put your guns on the ground! - Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.42,0:23:11.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Si. - They got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.17,0:23:13.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Cazzo! - Plan B?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.21,0:23:16.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes. Plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.33,0:23:37.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, you made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.04,0:23:40.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, what's that? - Jack's birthday present.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.00,0:23:44.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Baseball uniform, cleats, glove and a bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.67,0:23:50.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's his favourite sport. - It was. Last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.79,0:23:53.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's on a soccer team now. He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.87,0:23:57.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You know, you should see him sometime. - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.54,0:24:02.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Mr and Mrs Billings! They're coming! - Hide, everyone. Hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.42,0:24:11.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes. - Good morning, Mr Driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.75,0:24:15.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Who is this? - Look in your rear-view mirror and you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.92,0:24:19.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know what you're thinking. Bulletproof glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.67,0:24:25.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,So tell me, in your experience which judging from the performance you put on in the office
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.17,0:24:27.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,goes way beyond driving children to school
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.79,0:24:31.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,does bulletproof glass stop a 7.62 armour-piercing round?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.00,0:24:35.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Frank, why have you stopped the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.29,0:24:41.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't look, they are triangulated over 300 feet away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.29,0:24:42.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Frank, pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.75,0:24:48.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,You screwed up my plan. I am going to tell you how to set things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.29,0:24:52.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Someone is going to appear in a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.62,0:25:05.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.75,0:25:15.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.50,0:25:18.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good boy. Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.17,0:25:24.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.33,0:25:27.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Leave it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.58,0:25:34.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Personally, I hate kids. I don't know what your feelings are on the subject,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.50,0:25:40.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,but if you ever want to have any, make no moves but the moves I tell you to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.21,0:25:45.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're in her hands now. They can be gentle hands, but they can be the hands from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.21,0:25:48.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Trust me on this one. - Trust him on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.87,0:25:50.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.83,0:26:34.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Make a left.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.00,0:26:36.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I said left.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.83,0:27:02.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen, we keep doing this your way, they're gonna catch us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.12,0:27:05.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Do this my way, no one gets hurt. - Where's the fun in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.12,0:27:07.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's save the fun for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.58,0:27:16.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.12,0:29:01.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.37,0:29:04.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Didn't your mother teach you to say thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.17,0:29:06.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,She tried, and failed miserably.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.42,0:29:10.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I think we lost them. - Think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.79,0:29:17.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thought complete. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.04,0:29:52.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't find him? He's one man in one car. He's a chauffeur, for chrissakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.42,0:29:55.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not exactly, sir. There's a possibility he was in on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.83,0:29:58.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's impossible. - How would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.83,0:30:03.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,He could have been setting this up the whole time, and you wouldn't have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.29,0:30:07.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And you are an expert on knowing people. - His background.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.58,0:30:13.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's ex-Special Forces. Headed a commando unit. Specialised in search and destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.25,0:30:17.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Been in and out of Lebanon, Syria, Sudan. The man is a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.29,0:30:20.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't care what his skills are or where he's from.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.08,0:30:23.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is not a war zone, this is an American city!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.29,0:30:25.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's my son?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.62,0:30:56.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Last stop. All out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.42,0:31:02.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're quite a guy. Another time, another place...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.04,0:31:06.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,you and me, baby, the pleasure we could have.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.79,0:31:14.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.46,0:31:18.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.25,0:31:20.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Frank!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.50,0:31:23.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Frank!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.79,0:31:29.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not what you expected when you reported for work this morning, is it, Frank? No?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.17,0:31:32.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that what passes for wit in this circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.42,0:31:36.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,In this circle, my friend, wit is not a requirement of the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.37,0:31:40.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Brutality, yes. An ability to inflict pain, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.37,0:31:46.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,A certain psychotic, moral ignorance, blind obedience, all required.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.29,0:31:48.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,- But not wit. How was it? - Fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.92,0:31:51.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Only the beginning, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.00,0:31:56.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's this all about? - A timely question.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.21,0:31:58.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.37,0:32:00.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.62,0:32:12.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hello. - Put me on the speaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.67,0:32:16.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,In the next two hours, you'll get five million dollars in $100 bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.79,0:32:20.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Put them in a waterproof suitcase, go to the Bayfront Park, personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.83,0:32:25.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,There will be a blue Chrysler parked there. Place the suitcase in the trunk, and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.46,0:32:28.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can get five million dollars in two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.67,0:32:32.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,I read the newspapers. When you were appointed to your current position,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.79,0:32:36.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,your net worth exceeded 100 million dollars, so you won't even feel the bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.04,0:32:40.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,What guarantee do I have that you won't harm my son?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.62,0:32:44.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guarantee? Mr Billings, I am not a car dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.83,0:32:48.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't let the charming accent and my impeccable syntax mislead you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.96,0:32:52.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I live in the jungle, and in the jungle you either eat or be eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.83,0:32:55.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,But, in the spirit of business, here is the guarantee.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.96,0:32:59.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ten minutes past the deadline, if the money doesn't arrive, I send a finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.83,0:33:03.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,20 minutes, a hand. 30 minutes, a foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.79,0:33:06.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sounds like we have a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.58,0:33:09.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.12,0:33:12.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Could we please speak to our son?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.29,0:33:16.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mommy! Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.58,0:33:21.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have two hours, Mr Billings. Starting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.79,0:33:27.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Just get my son! - All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.58,0:33:31.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Frank, you promised you wouldn't let anybody hurt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.42,0:33:35.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You promised! - Never make promises you can't keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.87,0:33:39.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't. It's one of my rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.37,0:33:40.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.92,0:33:47.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bravo. A man who leads his life by rules. In my world rules are meant to be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.25,0:33:51.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Not mine. - You're gonna have to make an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.92,0:33:54.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.42,0:34:25.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Prego.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.33,0:34:38.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Go. - Hey, driver!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.21,0:34:46.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, wait, wait. A little distance between us isn't a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.21,0:34:49.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andiamo!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.54,0:35:00.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.21,0:35:36.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on. The signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.46,0:35:39.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hello. - It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.21,0:35:42.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You son of a bitch. - Look, I had nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.50,0:35:46.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- One scratch on his head... - Let me speak to who's in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.25,0:35:50.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- This is US Marshal Stappleton. - Act fast. There are three boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.21,0:35:53.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Tell us where you are. - Get a plane. They're heading north.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.71,0:35:56.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Tell me where you are. - Just tell us where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.87,0:35:58.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello, Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.25,0:36:01.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.46,0:36:32.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- All? - Tarconi, it's me. Get out of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.12,0:36:36.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I was just putting the madeleines... - Forget the madeleines, just get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.54,0:36:39.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And go where? - Anywhere. Go to the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.17,0:36:42.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, the beach. The famous Miami Beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.83,0:36:46.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my dream. I would love to go to the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.29,0:36:52.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.08,0:36:55.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Freeze! Who the fuck are you? - I'm the cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.83,0:37:01.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh. This is a mistake. A terrible mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.37,0:37:08.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why we can't all just get along, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.71,0:37:27.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hello. - It's Frank. Pretend it's someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.21,0:37:32.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi, Susan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.67,0:37:34.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I'm just here at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.92,0:37:38.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't do it, Audrey. She had a gun on Jack. I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.46,0:37:43.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I saw that. What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.21,0:37:46.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's more than a kidnapping. - They asked for a ransom.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.21,0:37:52.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,The doctors, they were fake. They were trying to give Jack a shot. When I interrupted them...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.17,0:37:59.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I promised Jack I wouldn't let anyone hurt him. I'm not gonna break that promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.29,0:38:01.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Frank. - I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.58,0:38:06.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.00,0:38:13.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is everything all right? - That's a pretty stupid question to ask, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.75,0:38:23.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. So tell me again, Inspector Tarconi,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.83,0:38:29.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,why you didn't immediately identify yourself as a police officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.67,0:38:35.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was overwhelmed by the effectiveness of your operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.29,0:38:37.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,the sophistication of your equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.62,0:38:43.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, I work in a small office in a small town. We only have small crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.50,0:38:47.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I was a little insecure. - You and Frank Martin are friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.50,0:38:53.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,A friend? Oh, I wouldn't say exactly a friend. I know him, we have a relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.71,0:38:55.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,A long relationship?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.92,0:38:58.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Not so long. - They found you cooking in his house.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.75,0:39:00.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm French! - So?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.25,0:39:05.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,We don't need to know someone a long time in order to cook for them. It's an icebreaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.50,0:39:10.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take, for example, this sandwich and coffee you so graciously offer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.58,0:39:13.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, pardon me to think so, but it's not very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.04,0:39:16.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know, but what has that got to do with anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.92,0:39:18.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you have a kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.54,0:39:22.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay back. Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.12,0:40:51.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't move. Smith!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.12,0:40:53.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.00,0:41:21.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Jesus. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.83,0:41:25.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.12,0:41:34.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is this safe? - Look over your shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.12,0:41:36.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,We got you covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.58,0:41:52.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,As my mother used to say, a meal is only limited by your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.75,0:41:55.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Creme brulee et croque monsieur. - Cream brulee?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.42,0:41:56.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Creme brulee. - Cock?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.79,0:41:59.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Croque monsieur. - Croque monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.96,0:42:03.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oui? - Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.08,0:42:06.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Cooking. - Cooking. Can you talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.54,0:42:09.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, speak of the devil. My mother. - Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.92,0:42:13.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please, do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.33,0:42:14.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.92,0:42:17.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oui, Maman. Je suis tres bien arrive?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.08,0:42:21.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oui, tres tres bien, merci. Oui. Ah, oui, c'est une tres jolie ville.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.25,0:42:25.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- May I ask who you're cooking for? - For the US marshals.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.37,0:42:30.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Once they found my badge, they were very polite. They gave me a coffee and a sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.04,0:42:33.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't believe what passes for food here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.92,0:42:39.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am correcting the situation while they wait for my chief to call and confirm everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.50,0:42:44.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course, that might take a while. He's never there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.46,0:42:47.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Anything about me? - They are very interested about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.96,0:42:51.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,They want to know where you are. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.04,0:42:55.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nowhere for very long. Listen, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.09,0:43:02.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you have access to a computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.08,0:43:05.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Easier than having access to something decent to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.96,0:43:25.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, handsome fellow. Who is he? - Do they have an ID program?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.79,0:43:31.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Forgive me. I'm not so used to this system. At home, there is one computer for ten of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.92,0:43:34.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, how is it with you, Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.37,0:43:37.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's a complicated story. - Ah, you mean you are in the shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.04,0:43:42.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You might say that. - In other words, your natural state.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.21,0:43:43.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Voil?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.83,0:43:50.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,A Russian biologist with advanced degrees from the state laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.67,0:43:56.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Do we have an address? - Miami, Boca West, King Street, number 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.75,0:45:41.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.42,0:46:09.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.83,0:46:16.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing? - Trying to catch a bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.87,0:46:20.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.42,0:46:41.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, driver? Not so good on the water, hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.42,0:46:45.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.96,0:47:19.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- OK. OK. - Tell me about the doctor's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.87,0:47:23.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What doctor's office? - Where you tried to stick the kid with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.50,0:47:25.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,You want to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.17,0:47:38.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you know what you have done? Do you know what you have done?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.71,0:47:43.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Obviously something not conducive to your good health, which is all I needed to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.96,0:47:46.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Have a good life...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.71,0:47:49.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,what's left of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.83,0:48:08.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Outpost to base. The ransom is still there. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.58,0:48:10.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,The ransom hasn't been picked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.62,0:48:14.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't worry. - What if it's notjust a kidnapping?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.12,0:48:18.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I've worked on many kidnapping cases. - If they don't take it I won't get my son back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.87,0:48:21.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't make this any more complicated than it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.00,0:48:26.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not making this complicated, Jefferson. It's because of yourjob.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.12,0:48:30.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What does my job have to do with this? - It has everything to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.17,0:48:33.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because you became famous, we became the targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.71,0:48:39.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,No matter what you think, the only one who's out there trying to get Jack back is Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.62,0:48:42.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The chauffeur? - You spoke to Frank Martin?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.33,0:48:48.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What the hell are you doing talking to him? - He's the last person who saw Jack alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.12,0:48:50.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've found the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.17,0:49:17.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hard drive blew.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.79,0:49:19.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Get another one in there. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.92,0:49:23.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How long is it gonna take? - Ma'am, we're going as fast as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.67,0:49:26.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He can suffocate in there. - Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.25,0:49:28.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's my son! - Let them work.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.46,0:49:31.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you gonna sit and do nothing? - They're experts.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.62,0:49:35.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everyone is an expert! I've had it with all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.54,0:49:37.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Audrey!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.46,0:49:42.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Audrey!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.08,0:49:44.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Audrey!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.37,0:49:51.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Audrey!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.33,0:49:55.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.17,0:50:00.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.00,0:50:03.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.17,0:50:11.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,There you go, little buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.21,0:50:18.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Breathe. Come on, breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.50,0:50:22.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're the devil. - I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.87,0:51:04.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Shit! Dimitri, you scare shit in me. - Where is Sonovitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.79,0:51:07.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,- In chamber. - I need to speak with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.92,0:51:12.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sit down! Listen Panasonic. Is rap music, is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.08,0:52:53.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What was that? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.04,0:52:56.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.83,0:52:59.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing? - I need antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.08,0:53:02.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,The driver, he inject me with virus. Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.29,0:53:06.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Dimitri, where would he get the virus? - The one we left in doctor's surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.75,0:53:09.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please, I need antidote. I am sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.83,0:53:14.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Calm down. You're not sick. You have four hours before the virus is active.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.08,0:53:16.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know that. You worked on creating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.62,0:53:20.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Open fridge. - I'm telling you...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.62,0:53:26.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,lzvinite. Open fridge. Open the fridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.79,0:53:30.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes. Insurance policy. How many you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.54,0:53:33.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two doses. Enough for Tipov and myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.00,0:53:41.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tipov's policy cancelled. There is one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.08,0:53:43.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I want it now. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.46,0:53:46.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.87,0:53:50.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Let's not. - Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.46,0:53:52.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- There is enough for two. - You don't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.79,0:53:55.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- But you injected me. - With water.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.54,0:53:58.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm not sick. - You're not sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.33,0:54:00.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Water. - Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.87,0:54:03.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Son of bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.20,0:54:11.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good. Our problem is solved. One dose for each of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.70,0:54:16.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's not for us. - One for you and one for the child. Touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.90,0:54:20.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,My patience is about to run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.75,0:54:29.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Tell me about the virus. - OK. What do you want know?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.33,0:54:31.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.08,0:54:34.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,A recombinant retroimmune double-polymorphing effluent.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.70,0:54:39.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,The child will die. Anyone he breathes on will die, and then it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.16,0:54:43.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What do you mean, ''It's over?'' - The virus goes inert after 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.87,0:54:47.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the lesson. Now give me the vials.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.87,0:54:53.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,You really want to play superhero, don't you? Well, let's see if you can fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.95,0:55:32.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You OK? - I'm OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.87,0:56:42.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to worry about. It's just a simple viral infection combined with stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.33,0:56:46.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,It should pass in a day or two. I gave him something to help him sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.25,0:56:50.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Call me if anything arises. - Thank you, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.25,0:56:56.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, Audrey, all this has...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.20,0:57:00.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,well, it's made me realise what a fool I've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.25,0:57:02.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,With Jack...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.66,0:57:05.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,and with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.83,0:57:12.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you OK? - Mr Billings. We're running late.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.95,0:57:18.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll be right out. I'd like to come by after the conference,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.37,0:57:21.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,check on Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.33,0:57:23.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Check on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.50,0:57:29.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good. I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.20,0:57:31.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're here if you need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.50,0:57:47.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you all right, ma'am? - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.45,0:57:53.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hello. - It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.58,0:57:55.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you OK? - Go to your bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.58,0:57:58.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi, Susan. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.37,0:58:03.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm alone. Where are you, Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.75,0:58:06.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.41,0:58:20.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Frank, you were wrong. It was a kidnapping. Jack is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.16,0:58:25.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jack's been infected with a virus. Anyone who comes into contact with him will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.70,0:58:28.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.33,0:58:33.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you telling me my son is gonna die? - No, he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.08,0:58:39.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Once incubated, the virus becomes airborne, so anyone he breathes on gets infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.62,0:58:42.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your son was a weapon. The target is his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.58,0:58:47.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Jefferson? Well, why? - The conference. It's the only logical answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.83,0:58:51.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Every drug-enforcement agency in one room.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.12,0:58:54.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your husband breathes, the room dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.25,0:59:02.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,You gotta trust me, Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.95,0:59:12.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you get to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.58,0:59:15.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you gonna do? - Find the guy responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.70,0:59:19.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,He has more of this. For you and everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.08,0:59:23.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,For you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.83,0:59:40.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have a guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.70,0:59:46.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're burning up. - I'm OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.12,0:59:48.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,You gotta go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.91,0:59:53.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.25,1:00:40.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is the governor here? - Everybody's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.66,1:00:43.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Delegates from all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.00,1:00:47.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Just a second. Hello. - Jefferson, you can't go to the conference.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.66,1:00:51.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is everything all right? - To give him a deadly virus...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.29,1:00:54.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I can't hear you. I'm inside. - I've got it, and so do you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.54,1:00:58.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I can't hear you. - Their plan is to infect everyone there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.29,1:01:01.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm gonna have to call you back. - Jeff!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.20,1:01:06.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr Billings, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.66,1:01:10.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm all right. Come on, let's go. - You sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.45,1:01:33.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,- All? - You still a guest of the government?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.75,1:01:38.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,They gave me the five-star accommodation. Let me guess you need my help.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.04,1:01:41.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you near the computer?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.62,1:01:45.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's practically my pillow. So, how do you want to start?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.25,1:01:51.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I don't know. I have nothing. - Ah. My favourite type of investigation.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.95,1:01:55.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's see. Alors.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.62,1:01:58.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd like to take this opportunity to introduce you to...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.04,1:02:03.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Breathe. That's right, breathe, my friend, breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.83,1:02:07.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Once these bastards are out of the way
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.29,1:02:12.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,and their agreements are dead and buried, you know what the biggest problem will be?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.50,1:02:15.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - Counting the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.00,1:02:22.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I can't wait. - Ay-ay-ay!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.00,1:02:30.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aah. Gianni Chellini.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.41,1:02:35.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hires himself out to anyone looking to make trouble: Red Brigade, Shining Path.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.41,1:02:41.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Someone accessed a database on the 15th floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.16,1:02:45.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's Gonzalez. He's on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.37,1:02:50.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Was behind the hostage-taking of the OPEC ministers in Geneva.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.41,1:02:52.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was a nice piece of work.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.25,1:02:59.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Give me an address. - Miami, East Highland,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.70,1:03:02.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pelican Drive, number 26900.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.12,1:03:05.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We've found the car. - You're one great cop, Tarconi.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.25,1:03:09.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the compliment. Now I'm going back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.62,1:03:14.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hm. Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.75,1:03:20.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Bumbaclaat, man! Move out the way! - Move over.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.12,1:03:22.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll do ya!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.29,1:03:32.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.54,1:03:38.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Honey. You feeling better? - A little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.20,1:03:41.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try to go back to sleep, OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.25,1:03:49.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.83,1:04:02.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jefferson. Jefferson, are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.00,1:05:09.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.62,1:05:25.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing? - You know, last night got me thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.95,1:05:28.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,How do we transport the antidote safely?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.62,1:05:32.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need something that won't break or can't be stolen.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.29,1:05:36.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Something totally secure. Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.33,1:05:45.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Impressive. Get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.29,1:05:48.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.50,1:05:54.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- These your friends? - Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.62,1:06:06.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where'd they go? - The garage.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.83,1:06:09.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm out of ammo. - Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.83,1:06:12.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- So am I. - Where are the reloads?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.08,1:06:13.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,The garage.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.95,1:06:17.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Check the house. Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.54,1:06:23.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get him! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.30,1:08:20.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What d'you want me to do? - Keep the meter running.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.75,1:08:26.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bye. Don't worry, baby. You're safe now. You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.13,1:08:30.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're so beautiful. Remind me of my yellow poom-poom rider.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.55,1:09:48.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.59,1:09:51.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, Mr Driver. - I'll blow you into tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.84,1:09:55.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll bleed what you came for all over the floor. You wouldn't want this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.96,1:09:59.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not after you worked so hard trying to get to the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.84,1:10:02.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take a good look, Frank Martin.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.50,1:10:06.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm a cure for what ails you. I'm the only cure for what ails you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.25,1:10:09.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.63,1:10:12.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice try. I'm impressed. I didn't give you enough credit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.05,1:10:17.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It took more than a driver to figure this out. - I haven't figured it all out yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.25,1:10:20.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I can help you. What part are you a little thick on?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.88,1:10:24.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You. Why? - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.30,1:10:30.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the easy part. It's a business deal, pure and simple. I'm for hire to the highest bidder.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.50,1:10:34.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,In this case, the highest bidder was the Colombian cocaine cartels
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.17,1:10:37.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,that wanted these pesky lawmen off their backs.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.67,1:10:41.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,You think killing politicians will make things easier for them?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.21,1:10:44.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's not my problem. I was hired to do a job.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.84,1:10:49.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,I did the job, like you. Just my pay is better.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.63,1:10:53.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,My hair and my suit, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.00,1:10:57.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lola.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.63,1:11:01.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll excuse me, I have a plane to catch.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.09,1:11:04.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.59,1:11:06.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ciao.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.25,1:11:12.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't even blink. - What's in this for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.80,1:11:14.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pleasure...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.34,1:11:20.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,in killing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.09,1:12:58.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're coming live from the Key Biscayne causeway
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.84,1:13:03.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,where at least ten police cars are in hot pursuit of a stolen red pick-up truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.38,1:13:10.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my. This is just nuts. Jim, are you getting that?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.75,1:13:15.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's another car that is swaying past the police, as if they were standing still.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.67,1:13:19.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Son of a bitch can drive. Whoo. - Yes, he can.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.88,1:14:08.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have clearance for takeoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.17,1:14:13.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sit back, enjoy your flight, and we will be in Colombia before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.50,1:15:00.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have a problem with the landing gear. I need to land.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.67,1:15:03.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can we fly with the problem? - Theoretically.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.25,1:15:07.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then you'll land when we get to Colombia.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.17,1:15:09.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go and see if you can lift it manually.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.96,1:15:13.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the inconvenience. Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.09,1:15:21.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry, flight's been cancelled.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.21,1:15:24.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to inform you that you have been cancelled.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.96,1:15:28.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.63,1:15:31.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.42,1:15:34.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Drink something. Let's get to know each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.63,1:15:38.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think I know everything I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.96,1:17:26.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.30,1:19:11.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Five points. What has eyes but no ears, skin but no hair,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.96,1:19:14.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,it's white inside and brown outside?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.13,1:19:16.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Mom? - A worm?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.13,1:19:19.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wrong. Dad? - A caterpillar.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.05,1:19:22.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wrong. - A potato.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.92,1:19:30.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- May I help you? - I was just leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.55,1:19:35.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Coconut. - Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.71,1:19:39.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- A snake. - Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.50,1:19:42.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- A peanut. - Yuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.88,1:19:45.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- A hot dog. - Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.05,1:20:00.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That was fast. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.50,1:20:07.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Didn't want you to miss your plane. - That's very thoughtful of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.88,1:20:17.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Check it out, my man.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.59,1:20:23.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,You won't believe what happened to me last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.09,1:20:32.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have something for you. Since you never got to the beach.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.71,1:20:38.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, you know, water's water, sand is sand. Here, there, it's all the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.25,1:20:40.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Flight 069 to Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.50,1:20:43.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Frank. It was an interesting vacation.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.67,1:20:47.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What more could one ask for? - Ah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.96,1:20:51.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Au revoir, Frank. - Au revoir, my friend. Have a good flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.88,1:20:54.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I doubt it. They said it is all headwinds.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.55,1:20:58.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess we can't have everything we wish for, can we?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.13,1:21:01.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, we can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.25,1:21:17.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.63,1:21:20.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a transporter.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.96,1:21:25.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:19.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,《非常人贩2》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.58,0:01:58.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,真对不起 可以帮我吗? 我的车胎...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.71,0:02:02.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我有约会 我不喜欢迟到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.25,0:02:05.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是喜欢迟到还是翘辫子呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.79,0:02:10.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不想这么做的 - 下车
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.58,0:02:19.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,上吧 大伙!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.96,0:02:23.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点 宝贝! 好耶!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:25.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,轻点 车是全新的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.71,0:02:31.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没问题 我有这个 - 宝贝 开车吧 该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.08,0:02:35.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你父母晓得你交这种朋友吗? - 闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:37.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 发不动 - 有设定密码
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.87,0:02:39.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 密码多少? - 我不能给你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:43.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们只好逼你招了 下车
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:46.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧 老兄 看你有何本事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.71,0:02:49.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,去你的!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.04,0:02:52.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.29,0:02:55.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,西装才刚从干洗店取回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.71,0:03:19.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,手举起来 别走动 否则我会开枪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.71,0:03:22.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没功课要做吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.33,0:03:27.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 为何不去做呢? - 好的 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:34.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.87,0:04:45.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿! 嘿!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.17,0:04:50.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 游戏 游戏 游戏! - 上别人车的第一条规矩是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:54.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 尊重别人的车 别人就会尊重你 - 第二条
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:59.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 跟车主打招呼 午安 法兰克 - 午安  杰克.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:03.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 可以玩游戏吗? - 我想你放学后很累
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.33,0:05:07.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你是怕我会赢 - 我怕你太累了无法做作业
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.29,0:05:11.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 今天是星期五 根本没作业 - 果真那样就来玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.50,0:05:16.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好耶! - 不过前提 第三条规矩是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:17.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:38.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,答对得五分 既白又圆 但不一定都在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:42.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 网球? - 网球是黄色的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:57.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,答对得四分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:06:01.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,有时一半 有时完整 有时只有一小片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.17,0:06:03.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 一条面包? - 不对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.67,0:06:12.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,答对得三分 有时亮 有时暗 有时两者皆是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:14.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我知道了 是电灯泡 - 不对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:17.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 披萨! - 不对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:21.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,奥黛莉 奥黛莉! 别走开
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:25.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,听我说 我们必须把话谈完
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.79,0:07:29.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,他要开去哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.17,0:07:35.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的 看着我 剩下分数的最后线索
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.79,0:07:40.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,人人都想踏上我 但只有少数幸运儿办到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.50,0:07:42.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,慢慢想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:54.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 小鬼头 - 嘘! 妈 在玩游戏 我拼命在想呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.12,0:07:57.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 对不起嘛! 法兰克 你今天好吗? - 很好 毕林斯太太
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:01.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我可以跟我妈一组吗? - 不知道 规则上没定
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.67,0:08:05.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托 要是不懂得变通 订规则有何意义呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:08.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 下不为例 - 耶!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.58,0:08:11.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了 给我些线索
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.46,0:08:17.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,圆的 但不一定在 有时亮 有时暗 或两者皆是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.17,0:08:21.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,人人都想踏上我 但只有少数幸运儿办到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:25.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这题满难的 - 告诉我答案吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.67,0:08:31.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 月亮! - 正确
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.54,0:08:33.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,干的好 好了 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.92,0:08:36.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 周一见 - 拜 法兰克 谢啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:39.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你的点心在厨房里 - 拜 妈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:42.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你跟我们在一起的这个月 他真的很喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.33,0:08:46.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 彼此 - 可惜东尼一回来 你就不能留下了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:49.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是帮忙一下 我通常不接这种工作
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:53.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还以为你是职业驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.25,0:08:55.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,不同性质的驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:09:01.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不在 我们都会想念你的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:09.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:12.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.75,0:09:15.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:19.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,把车子转过头去 杰克才不必见到我们夫妻吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:23.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你真的很懂小孩 对不对? - 我懂得吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:26.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,他好几个月没见到杰克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:29.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,结果一回来 只听到他在责骂我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:35.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,原以为分居一年后他会...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.46,0:09:40.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起 你不必听这些的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:46.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,没关系 值得的是 我认为杰克你照顾的很好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:47.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.83,0:09:50.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,有何需要帮忙的话 随时都能找我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.92,0:09:53.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你人真好 法兰克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.04,0:09:56.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,这句话我可能得好好利用了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:05.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我差点忘了 我明早应该载杰克 去给医生健康检查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.21,0:10:10.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我在帮他筹办个派对 虽然下周才是他的生日
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.79,0:10:18.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,当我在布置和迎接他的朋友到来时 我想说 若你不介意的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.62,0:10:21.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我会载他去的 - 打扰到你的周末真不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.96,0:10:25.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是那天稍晚 要去机场接个朋友而已
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:27.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不错嘛 - 怎么说?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:31.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,保全的人说你有点独来独往...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:35.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 只是很高兴听见你有朋友 - 他不太算是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.00,0:10:38.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是法国人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.37,0:10:41.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,回头再打给你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:44.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,奥黛莉 我想把我们的话说完
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.67,0:10:52.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是十点前有任何变卦 就打我手机
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.79,0:10:57.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不会有变卦的 毕林斯太太 - 叫我奥黛莉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.08,0:10:58.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,奥黛莉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.71,0:11:31.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喂? - 确定明天上午九点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.17,0:12:24.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,天上午九点 唯一有变的 是由司机载他 不是母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.21,0:12:25.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,那更好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.87,0:12:34.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,维斯利?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.75,0:12:47.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 稳定吗? - 是的 很稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:49.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,解毒剂呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:12:59.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,明天见了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.00,0:13:14.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,六名拉丁美洲国家的 药品管制局局长
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.71,0:13:16.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,抵达迈阿密参加高峰会议...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:20.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 法兰克马汀 帕草地街1156号
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.58,0:13:25.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在等你们的外送 你们45分钟前也这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.75,0:13:29.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不需要别的 只要披萨就好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.83,0:13:32.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不会付... - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:34.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.83,0:13:40.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,因此是中型披萨 不加干酪 多加了橄榄和鳀鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:42.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,一共是11.95美元
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:45.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 希望您饿了 - 这可难说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.75,0:13:49.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,很抱歉延误送达 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.42,0:13:52.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,毕林斯太太
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.46,0:13:57.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,奥黛莉 奥黛莉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.25,0:14:01.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛? - 我样子像在干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.87,0:14:06.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你喝醉了吗? - 一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.96,0:14:11.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说过我有何需要的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.17,0:14:15.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 为什么? 因为我的身份吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:19.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,是因为我的身份
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.67,0:14:32.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得好迷惘 好困惑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.87,0:14:36.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁不是呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:48.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 法兰克
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:52.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,多谢你的拨空以及...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:55.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的尊重
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.42,0:14:58.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想那才是我最需要的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:02.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:37.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 要打针吗? - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.21,0:16:05.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 老天 我们还没营业呢 - 很紧急 我需要立刻见医生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.21,0:16:09.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,好 柯布林医生 麻烦您过来 这儿有个病人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.75,0:16:12.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你必须叙述一下你的生理毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.33,0:16:17.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,事实上 我的毛病不是生理上的 是心理上的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.79,0:16:20.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,萝拉 毛病是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.46,0:16:22.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.67,0:16:25.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我讨厌打针
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.21,0:16:29.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,第一点 你不一定要打针
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.25,0:16:33.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,因此没必要杞人忧天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:41.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 给我说好消息 - 医生说我痊愈了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.67,0:16:46.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 法兰克 打针很痛耶 - 我绝不会让任何人伤害你的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.87,0:16:49.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你保证? - 知道我的第四条规矩吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:54.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,绝不做无法遵守的承诺 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.17,0:16:58.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,关门
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.87,0:17:08.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:17.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有何效劳呢? - 杰克毕林斯来见柯布林医生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:20.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉 他今天请病假 他要去看泰勃医生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.75,0:17:24.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢柯布林医生 - 别担心 泰勃医生人非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.00,0:17:27.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,带他去三号房吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:29.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 萝拉在哪里? - 谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:32.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你站在她的位置上 - 那个萝拉喔 她也请病假了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:37.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,最近流行性感冒盛行 快点 医生很忙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.21,0:17:40.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧 一下子就看完了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.92,0:17:43.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.67,0:17:47.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是泰勃医生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.33,0:17:49.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能等我的医生来再看吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:52.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,很遗憾 你的医生接到急诊外出
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.87,0:17:56.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 护士说他得了感冒 - 那就是急诊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.08,0:18:02.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,他突然染上了感冒 我们越早开始就越早结束
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.71,0:18:06.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,来 我带你看样非常酷的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:09.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,不好意思 医生病患之间的隐密空间
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:13.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以在接待区等候 或去喝杯水 或者...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.33,0:18:17.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 信任我 我是医生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.75,0:18:19.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,请 你有电话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:27.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喂? - 喂喂? 法兰克? 我到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.12,0:18:30.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你提早到了 - 对 碰到顺风
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.12,0:18:32.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我的假期多出了两小时 就那样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:36.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,从现在起 要我搭飞机 不是顺风就免谈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.92,0:18:39.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,很庆幸你没挂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.29,0:18:46.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好 抱歉 杜尼兹医生今天不在 周一再打来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.17,0:18:56.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有点走不开 你搭计程车好吗? 你有我地址的 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.17,0:19:02.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢 我听说这儿的鱼肉很美味 我可以替我们煮锅法式海龙皇汤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.29,0:19:05.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你喜欢法式海龙皇汤吧 法兰克?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:08.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得挂断了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.46,0:19:09.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,法兰克!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.71,0:19:12.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许我们等 他固定看诊的医生回来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:15.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,接种疫苗是很重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.29,0:19:19.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 当然 不过等个一星期没什么差别 - 不 我们现在就要注射
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.50,0:19:43.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,继续走 杰克!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.96,0:20:56.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,看着我 看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:21:00.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 记得我的承诺吗? - 记得
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.62,0:21:22.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是...是我! - 出去!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.21,0:21:29.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,法兰克
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.83,0:22:00.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.00,0:22:13.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,病人不合作 准备安装车辆
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.87,0:22:29.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点 快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.17,0:22:35.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心 一切会没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.42,0:23:07.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不准动! 把枪放在地上! - 趴下!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.42,0:23:11.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 说吧 - 他们逃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.17,0:23:13.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 干! - B计划?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.21,0:23:16.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 B计划
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.33,0:23:37.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 你赶来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.04,0:23:40.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么东西? - 杰克的生日礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.00,0:23:44.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,棒球衣 球鞋 手套和球棒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.67,0:23:50.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他最喜欢的运动 - 以前是 去年吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.79,0:23:53.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,他现在进足球队 踢的不错
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.87,0:23:57.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你应该有空多看看他 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.54,0:24:02.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 毕林斯夫妇! 他们来了! - 快躲 大家躲起来!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.42,0:24:11.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 早安 司机先生
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.75,0:24:15.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你是哪位? - 看看你的后照镜就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.92,0:24:19.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我晓得你在想什么 防弹玻璃
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.67,0:24:25.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以依你的经验中告诉我 根据你在诊所里的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.17,0:24:27.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,远远超乎了载送小孩上学
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.79,0:24:31.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,防弹玻璃能挡得住 7.62厘米的穿甲弹吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.00,0:24:35.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,法兰克 你为何停车呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.29,0:24:41.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,不用看了 他们分布三边 在三百尺远的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.29,0:24:42.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,法兰克 快接呀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.75,0:24:48.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,你砸了我的计划 我要告诉你如何挽救
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.29,0:24:52.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,几秒钟后会有人出现
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.62,0:25:05.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,让她上车
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.75,0:25:15.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,司机
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.50,0:25:18.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,乖孩子呀乖孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.17,0:25:24.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.33,0:25:27.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,扣着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.58,0:25:34.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我个人讨厌小孩 我不清楚你这方面感觉如何
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.50,0:25:40.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,但如果你还想有感觉的话 就别轻举妄动
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.21,0:25:45.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你现在落入她手中 他们可以温文儒雅 也可以心狠手辣
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.21,0:25:48.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 相信我说的话 - 相信他说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.87,0:25:50.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在 开车吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.83,0:26:34.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,左转
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.00,0:26:36.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说左转
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.83,0:27:02.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,听我说 照你的方式继续下去 他们会追上我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.12,0:27:05.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 照我的方式做 没人会受伤 - 那样子有何乐趣呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.12,0:27:07.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,乐趣留到以后吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.58,0:27:16.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿! 小心
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.12,0:29:01.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,技术不赖嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.37,0:29:04.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你母亲没教你要说谢谢吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.17,0:29:06.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,她试过 可惜失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.42,0:29:10.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我想我们甩掉他们了 - 再想一遍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.79,0:29:17.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,想完了 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.04,0:29:52.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,找不到他? 他开着一辆车 拜托 他只是名司机啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.42,0:29:55.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,不一定 先生 有可能他也有参与
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.83,0:29:58.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不可能 - 你怎会知道?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.83,0:30:03.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,他在这工作了一个月 可能这段期间 都在设计此事你也不晓得
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.29,0:30:07.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你真是识人一流的专家唷 - 他的背景资料
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.58,0:30:13.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是前特种部队人员 突击队单位 专长是搜索和破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.25,0:30:17.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,曾经进出过黎巴嫩 叙利亚 苏丹 这人是个猎人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.29,0:30:20.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不管他有何专长或来自哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.08,0:30:23.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿不是战场 这是美国城市!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.29,0:30:25.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的儿子在哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.62,0:30:56.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,终点站 通通下车
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.42,0:31:02.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真有男子气概 假时假地...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.04,0:31:06.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和我 宝贝 我们可以很爽的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.79,0:31:14.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.46,0:31:18.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,法兰克
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.25,0:31:20.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,法兰克!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.50,0:31:23.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,法兰克!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.79,0:31:29.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟你今早预计的工作内容不一样 是不是啊 法兰克?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.17,0:31:32.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,在这圈子里就这么点聪明吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.42,0:31:36.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,在这圈子里 我的朋友 聪明并非工作的需求资格
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.37,0:31:40.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,心狠手辣才是 手段凶残能力 绝对必备
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.37,0:31:46.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,丧心病狂 道德泯灭 盲目服从 全都需要
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.29,0:31:48.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 但绝非聪明! 怎样? - 好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.92,0:31:51.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,这仅是开端 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.00,0:31:56.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是怎么回事? - 问的刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.21,0:31:58.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,麦克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.37,0:32:00.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,恕我失陪
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.62,0:32:12.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 接到扩音机上
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.67,0:32:16.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,两小时后 筹五百万元 以百元钞票装
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.79,0:32:20.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,放进防水手提箱内 你亲自提到湾前公园
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.83,0:32:25.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,那边会停着一辆蓝色克莱斯勒车子 把手提箱放进后车厢后离开
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.46,0:32:28.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不清楚两小时内 筹不筹得到五百万
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.67,0:32:32.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我读过报纸的 当你被任命你目前的职位
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.79,0:32:36.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的净值收入就超过一百万美元 所以对你根本是九牛一毛
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.04,0:32:40.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有何保证 你不会伤害我儿子呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.62,0:32:44.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,保证? 毕林斯先生 我不是车商
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.83,0:32:48.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,别让这迷人的口音 和我无懈可击的语法误导了你
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.96,0:32:52.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我住在丛林里 而在丛林里 不是吃人就是被吃
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.83,0:32:55.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是 本着商场精神 保证如下:
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.96,0:32:59.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,超过底限十分钟后 如果钱还没送到 我会送一根指头
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.83,0:33:03.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,二十分钟后 送一只手 三十分钟后 送一只脚
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.79,0:33:06.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,听起来我们条件谈成了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.58,0:33:09.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,一言为定
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.12,0:33:12.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以让我们跟我们儿子讲话吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.29,0:33:16.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈咪! 妈咪!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.58,0:33:21.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有两小时时间 毕林斯先生 现在开始计时
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.79,0:33:27.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 救出我儿子! - 好的 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.58,0:33:31.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,法兰克 你保证过 不会让任何人伤害我!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.42,0:33:35.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你保证过的! - 千万别下无法遵守的承诺
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.87,0:33:39.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不会 这是我的原则之一
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.37,0:33:40.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.92,0:33:47.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,好呀 一个生活有原则的男人 在我的世界中 原则就是用来打破的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.25,0:33:51.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我的可不行 - 你不得不破个例了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.92,0:33:54.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.42,0:34:25.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,请
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.33,0:34:38.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 走 - 嘿 司机!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.21,0:34:46.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不 等等 等等 我们之间保持点距离不是坏事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.21,0:34:49.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,快!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.54,0:35:00.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.21,0:35:36.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等 讯号
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.46,0:35:39.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 是我
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.21,0:35:42.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你这婊养的 - 听着 我和这事毫无关连
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.50,0:35:46.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他若少根寒毛... - 让我跟负责人讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.25,0:35:50.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我是史坦雷顿警官 - 行动要快 有三艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.21,0:35:53.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 告诉我们你的位置 - 弄辆飞机 他们朝北边去了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.71,0:35:56.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 告诉我们你的位置 - 告诉我们你的位置!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.87,0:35:58.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂 法兰克?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.25,0:36:01.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,锁定了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.46,0:36:32.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喂? - 塔科尼 是我 快离开房子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.12,0:36:36.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不行 我才刚摆玛德琳蛋糕进去烤... - 别管玛德琳蛋糕了 离开就是
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.54,0:36:39.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 去哪? - 哪里都行 去海滩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.17,0:36:42.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,喔 海滩哟 著名的迈阿密海滩
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.83,0:36:46.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我梦寐以求呢 我很想去海滩
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.29,0:36:52.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许不
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.08,0:36:55.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不准动! 你他妈的是谁? - 我是厨师
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.83,0:37:01.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是误会啦 天大的误会
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.37,0:37:08.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们为何不能和平相处呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.71,0:37:27.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 我是法兰克 假装是别人打来的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.21,0:37:32.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 苏珊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.67,0:37:34.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 我刚到家
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.92,0:37:38.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是我干的 奥黛莉 她枪抵着杰克 我别无选择
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.46,0:37:43.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯 我看到了 你知道什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.21,0:37:46.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 目的不光是绑架而已 - 他们有要求赎金啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.21,0:37:52.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,医生全是假的 我闯进去时 他们正想给杰克打针...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.17,0:37:59.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我答应过杰克不会让任何人伤害他 我不会违背誓言的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.29,0:38:01.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 法兰克 - 我再打给你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.58,0:38:06.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,奥黛莉
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.00,0:38:13.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 一切没问题吧? - 你问这问题相当愚蠢 杰夫
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.75,0:38:23.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了 再跟我说一遍 塔科尼警官
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.83,0:38:29.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为何没立即表明 自己是警务人员身份?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.67,0:38:35.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,喔 我被你们的行动效率吓呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.29,0:38:37.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们的装备精良先进
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.62,0:38:43.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在小地方的小警局里任职 只有零星犯罪事件
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.50,0:38:47.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我有点不保险 - 你和法兰克马汀是朋友 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.50,0:38:53.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,朋友? 也称不上是朋友啦 我认识他 我们之间有种关系
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.71,0:38:55.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,长期关系?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.92,0:38:58.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不是很久 - 他们发现你在他房子里作菜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.75,0:39:00.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我是法国人! - 那又怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.25,0:39:05.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不需要认识很久才能下厨 那是促进情感的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.50,0:39:10.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,就拿你好心给我 三明治和咖啡的例子来说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.58,0:39:13.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,恕我无礼 但这难吃的要命
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.04,0:39:16.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道是很难吃 不过有何关连呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.92,0:39:18.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们有厨房吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.54,0:39:22.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,退后 退后
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.12,0:40:51.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,别动! 史密斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.12,0:40:53.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,放下
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.00,0:41:21.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊 发生了什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.83,0:41:25.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会帮你医好的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.12,0:41:34.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你确定这安全吗? - 朝你肩膀看过去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.12,0:41:36.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,团团掩护着你
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.58,0:41:52.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我母亲以前常说 餐点仅局限于你的想像力
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.75,0:41:55.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 火腿乳酪三明治 - 奶油三明治?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.42,0:41:56.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 乳酪三明治 - 乳奶?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.79,0:41:59.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 火腿乳酪三明治 - 火腿乳酪三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.96,0:42:03.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喂? - 你在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.08,0:42:06.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 作菜 - 作菜 方便讲话吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.54,0:42:09.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 说曹操曹操就到 是我母亲 - 妈
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.92,0:42:13.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,麻烦一下 不介意吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.33,0:42:14.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.92,0:42:17.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 妈 我已经到了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.08,0:42:21.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 非常非常好 谢谢 啊 对 这座城市非常漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.25,0:42:25.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 可以问你在替谁作菜吗? - 替美国警官们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.37,0:42:30.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们一发现我的警徽就变得彬彬有礼 还递给我咖啡和三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.04,0:42:33.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不会相信这儿的食物有多糟
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.92,0:42:39.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,趁他们等我局长来电证实一切时 我在修正这种情况
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.50,0:42:44.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然 可能要花一阵子 他不在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.46,0:42:47.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有提到我吗? - 有的 他们对你非常感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.96,0:42:51.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们想知道你在哪里 你在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.04,0:42:55.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,老早就不知身在何处了 听着 别挂断
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.46,0:42:59.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,(上锁)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.09,0:43:02.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以使用电脑吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.08,0:43:05.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,比吃到正经食物还容易
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.96,0:43:25.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 帅小子 他是谁? - 我正想知道 有身份识别程式吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.79,0:43:31.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不太习惯这系统 在老家 我们十个人才配给一台电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.92,0:43:34.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的情况怎样 法兰克?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.37,0:43:37.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 说来复杂 - 你是指你踩到狗屎了?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.04,0:43:42.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 可以那么说 - 换句话说 你早习以为常了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.21,0:43:43.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.83,0:43:50.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,俄罗斯生物学家 具有官方实验室高等学位
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.67,0:43:56.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有地址吗? - 迈阿密波卡西区国王街11号
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.75,0:45:41.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,滚开!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.42,0:46:09.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.83,0:46:16.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你想干嘛? - 想赶搭公车
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.87,0:46:20.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.42,0:46:41.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛呀 司机? 在水上技术不太好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.42,0:46:45.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,停啦! 停啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.96,0:47:19.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好的 好的 - 跟我说说医生诊疗室的事
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.87,0:47:23.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么医生诊疗室? - 你们想用这注射那孩子的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.50,0:47:25.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,想告诉我吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.17,0:47:38.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道你干了什么好事吗? 你知道你干了什么好事吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.71,0:47:43.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,显然是无益健康 也是我需要知道的事
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.96,0:47:46.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,好好享受美好人生...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.71,0:47:49.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,仅剩的时日吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.83,0:48:08.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 前哨回报基地 赎金还在原地 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.58,0:48:10.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,赎金还没被取走
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.62,0:48:14.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别担心 - 万一不光是绑架那么简单呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.12,0:48:18.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我处理过无数绑架案件 - 他们不取赎金 我儿子是不是就回不来?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.87,0:48:21.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,别让此事更加复杂了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.00,0:48:26.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没使它复杂 杰佛逊 是因为你工作的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.12,0:48:30.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我的工作和此事有何关系? - 完全有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.17,0:48:33.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不懂吗? 因为你出名了 我们便成为标靶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.71,0:48:39.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管你们怎么想 外面想救杰克回来的只有法兰克
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.62,0:48:42.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那个司机? - 你跟法兰克马汀讲过话?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.33,0:48:48.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你到底干嘛跟他讲话? - 他是最后一个看见杰克活着的人!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.12,0:48:50.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,找到男孩了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.17,0:49:17.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,硬碟爆了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.79,0:49:19.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 再拿一个装进去 - 是 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.92,0:49:23.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这要花多久时间? - 夫人 我们会尽快的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.67,0:49:26.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他会闷死在里面 - 保持镇静
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.25,0:49:28.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是我儿子呀! - 让他们做事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.46,0:49:31.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你光会坐着什么也不做吗? - 他们是专家呀
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.62,0:49:35.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,人人都是专家! 我受够你们所有人了!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.54,0:49:37.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,奥黛莉!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.46,0:49:42.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,奥黛莉!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.08,0:49:44.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,奥黛莉!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.37,0:49:51.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,奥黛莉!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.33,0:49:55.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈咪!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.17,0:50:00.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.00,0:50:03.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不要紧吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.17,0:50:11.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了 小子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.21,0:50:18.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,呼吸呀 快点呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.50,0:50:22.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你真是恶魔 - 但愿如此
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.87,0:51:04.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 可恶! 狄米崔 你吓死我了 - 索诺维契在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.79,0:51:07.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 在小房间里 - 我需要马上找他谈
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.92,0:51:12.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,坐下! 听听Panasonic 是饶舌音乐 很不错的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.08,0:52:53.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事? - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.04,0:52:56.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,可恶!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.83,0:52:59.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你进来干嘛? - 我需要解毒剂
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.08,0:53:02.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,那司机给我注射了病毒 你看!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.29,0:53:06.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 狄米崔 他从哪弄到病毒的? - 我们掉在医生诊疗室的那支
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.75,0:53:09.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,求求你 我需要解毒剂 我生病了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.83,0:53:14.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,冷静点 你没生病 病毒生效前你还有四小时
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.08,0:53:16.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道的 你有参与研发的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.62,0:53:20.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 冰箱打开 - 我告诉你...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.62,0:53:26.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起 冰箱打开 冰箱打开!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.79,0:53:30.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 保险策略 你有多少?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.54,0:53:33.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,两剂 够提巴夫和我自己用
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.00,0:53:41.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,提巴夫的策略取消了 一剂给我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.08,0:53:43.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在就要 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.46,0:53:46.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点 动手吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.87,0:53:50.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 休想 - 你是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.46,0:53:52.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 够两人用 - 你不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.79,0:53:55.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 但你给我注射了呀 - 里头是水
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.54,0:53:58.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我没生病? - 你没生病
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.33,0:54:00.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 水? - 水
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.87,0:54:03.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,王八蛋!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.20,0:54:11.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好 我们的问题解决了 我们一人一剂
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.70,0:54:16.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不是给我们 - 一剂给你 一剂给那孩子 真令人感动
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.90,0:54:20.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的耐性快用完了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.75,0:54:29.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 告诉我病毒的事 - 好 你想知道些什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.33,0:54:31.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,一切 怎么发生的?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.08,0:54:34.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,释放出一种重新组合的 免疫退化同质多晶型体
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.70,0:54:39.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,那孩子会死 任何呼吸到 他喘息的人也会死 然后就结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.16,0:54:43.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你说"结束"是什么意思? - 病毒入侵24小时后死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.87,0:54:47.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,多谢你的讲解 现在把瓶子给我
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.87,0:54:53.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真想扮超级英雄 是不是? 那就看看你会不会飞了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.95,0:55:32.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不要紧吧? - 不要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.87,0:56:42.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,没什么好担心的 只是轻微的传染病加上压力所致
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.33,0:56:46.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,应该过个一两天就会好的 我给他开点药方帮助他睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.25,0:56:50.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 病情若有变化再通知我 - 谢谢你 医生
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.25,0:56:56.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,奥黛莉 这件事...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.20,0:57:00.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,令我明了到我过去有多混帐
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.25,0:57:02.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,对杰克...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.66,0:57:05.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,以及对你
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.83,0:57:12.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧? - 毕林斯先生 我们要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.95,0:57:18.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我马上出去 开完会之后我再过来
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.37,0:57:21.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看杰克
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.33,0:57:23.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看你
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.50,0:57:29.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好 晚点见了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.20,0:57:31.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,有事的话 门外有警卫
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.50,0:57:47.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧 夫人? - 我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.45,0:57:53.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 是我
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.58,0:57:55.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没事吧? - 回你卧房
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.58,0:57:58.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 苏珊 你好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.37,0:58:03.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在一个人了 你在哪 法兰克?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.75,0:58:06.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,转身
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.41,0:58:20.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,法兰克 你错了 只是绑架而已 杰克好端端的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.16,0:58:25.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克已经感染了病毒 凡是接触到他的人都会死
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.70,0:58:28.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.33,0:58:33.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你是在说我儿子会死吗? - 不 他不会
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.08,0:58:39.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,一旦潜伏体内 病毒便利用空气传播 所以任何呼吸到的人也会感染上
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.62,0:58:42.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你儿子是武器 目标是他父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.58,0:58:47.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 杰佛逊? 为什么? - 会议是唯一合乎逻辑的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.83,0:58:51.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,各个药品管制局机关人员齐聚一堂
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.12,0:58:54.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的丈夫一呼吸 整个房间的人都会死
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.25,0:59:02.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,你得信任我 奥黛莉
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.95,0:59:12.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能连络上他吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.58,0:59:15.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你要怎么做? - 找出该负责的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.70,0:59:19.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,他有更多解毒剂 可供你和其他人用
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.08,0:59:23.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,也为了你
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.83,0:59:40.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人闯入了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.70,0:59:46.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你发烧了 - 我不要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.12,0:59:48.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你得走了 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.91,0:59:53.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,别动!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.25,1:00:40.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 首长来了吗? - 大家都会来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.66,1:00:43.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,来自全球各地的代表
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.00,1:00:47.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 稍等一下 喂 - 杰佛逊 你不能参加会议
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.66,1:00:51.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 一切可好? - 给他一种致命的病毒...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.29,1:00:54.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我听不见你 我在室内 - 既然我听的到 你也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.54,1:00:58.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我听不见你 - 他们计划感染那儿的每个人
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.29,1:01:01.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我回头再给你电话 - 杰夫!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.20,1:01:06.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,毕林斯先生 你不要紧吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.66,1:01:10.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不要紧 快点 我们走吧 - 你确定?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.45,1:01:33.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喂? - 你还在当政府座上佳宾啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.75,1:01:38.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们给了我五星级的食宿 让我猜一下 你需要我的帮助
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.04,1:01:41.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你离电脑近吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.62,1:01:45.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,差不多算是我的枕头了 你想如何着手?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.25,1:01:51.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不知道 毫无头绪 - 我最喜爱的侦办类型
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.95,1:01:55.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我瞧瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.62,1:01:58.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想藉这个机会向各位介绍...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.04,1:02:03.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,呼吸 没错 呼吸 我的朋友 呼吸
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.83,1:02:07.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,明天 一旦这些混蛋上了黄泉路
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.29,1:02:12.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们的协议就会石沉大海 你知道最大的问题会是什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.50,1:02:15.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 数钱啦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.00,1:02:22.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我等不及明天了 - 哎呀呀
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.00,1:02:30.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,吉亚尼切里尼
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.41,1:02:35.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,受雇于任何想制造麻烦的人: 义大利红色旅 秘鲁光辉道路组织
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.41,1:02:41.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,十五楼有人登入资料库
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.16,1:02:45.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,是刚萨雷兹 他休假了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.37,1:02:50.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,幕后策划日内瓦 石油输出国家组织官员劫持人质事件
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.41,1:02:52.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,那一票干的干净俐落
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.25,1:02:59.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 地址给我 - 迈阿密东高地区...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.70,1:03:02.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,鹈鹕大道26900号
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.12,1:03:05.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们找到了车子 - 你是一流警察 塔科尼
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.25,1:03:09.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,多谢你的赞美 现在我要去睡回笼觉了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.62,1:03:14.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许不
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.75,1:03:20.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 闪一边去 老兄! 让开! - 坐到一旁去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.12,1:03:22.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会...乖乖照做
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.29,1:03:32.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈咪
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.54,1:03:38.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 甜心 你好点了吗? - 一点点
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.20,1:03:41.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你何不再继续睡 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.25,1:03:49.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,夫人 你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.83,1:04:02.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰佛逊 杰佛逊 你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.00,1:05:09.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的 动手
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.62,1:05:25.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你在做什么? - 昨晚我考虑过
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.95,1:05:28.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎样安全运送解毒剂
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.62,1:05:32.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们需要不会打破 不会被偷
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.29,1:05:36.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,彻底安全的东西 就是我
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.33,1:05:45.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,真厉害 去穿上衣服吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.29,1:05:48.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,阻止他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.50,1:05:54.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这些是你朋友? - 还不是
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.62,1:06:06.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他们跑去哪了? - 车库
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.83,1:06:09.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我弹药打光了 - 我也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.83,1:06:12.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我也是 - 弹药在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.08,1:06:13.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,车库
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.95,1:06:17.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,检查房子 快快快!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.54,1:06:23.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,去抓他! 去抓他!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.30,1:08:20.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你要我怎么做? - 让车子保持发动
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.75,1:08:26.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜 别担心 宝贝 你现在安全了 你安全了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.13,1:08:30.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好美 令我想起了我的黄包车
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.55,1:09:48.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.59,1:09:51.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 司机先生 - 我会叫你脑袋开花
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.84,1:09:55.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你来的目的是想教我血溅地板 你不会想这样吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.96,1:09:59.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,在你这么卖命想取得解毒剂后 这样可行不通
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.84,1:10:02.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,好好瞧一下 法兰克马汀
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.50,1:10:06.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就是令你头疼的解药 唯一的解药
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.25,1:10:09.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就是解毒剂
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.63,1:10:12.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,干的不错 我很印象深刻 我不太相信你
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.05,1:10:17.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 一名司机是理解不出的 - 我还没完全理解
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.25,1:10:20.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,或许我能帮忙你 你有哪部份搞不懂?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.88,1:10:24.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你 为什么? - 哇
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.30,1:10:30.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,那部份很容易说明 纯粹是生意交易 谁出价最高 我就受雇于谁
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.50,1:10:34.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,在此例中 出价最高的是 哥伦比亚古柯碱毒枭
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.17,1:10:37.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们想除掉这些讨厌的执法者
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.67,1:10:41.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真以为杀死这些政客 他们运毒就会更容易吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.21,1:10:44.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,那不是我的问题 我是受雇办事的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.84,1:10:49.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我完成了使命 像你一样 只不过我的酬劳比较优渥
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.63,1:10:53.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的头发和西装也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.00,1:10:57.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 萝拉
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.63,1:11:01.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,恕我失陪了 我有飞机要赶
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.09,1:11:04.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.59,1:11:06.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.25,1:11:12.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别想眨一下眼 - 这事对你有何乐趣?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.80,1:11:14.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,乐趣...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.34,1:11:20.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是杀你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.09,1:12:58.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在从必士京跨海大桥 实况转播
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.84,1:13:03.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,至少有十辆警车正在全力追逐 一辆失窃的红色平板卡车
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.38,1:13:10.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,老天 真是有够疯的了 吉姆 你有拍到吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.75,1:13:15.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,有另一辆车疾驶过警车 警车就好像静止不动似的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.67,1:13:19.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 王八蛋真会开车呢 - 一点也没错
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.88,1:14:08.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,跑道已清除干净
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.17,1:14:13.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,坐下来好好享受你的飞行 不知不觉中我们就到哥伦比亚了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.50,1:15:00.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,起落架出了毛病 我必须重新降落
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.67,1:15:03.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 飞有问题吗? - 理论上是没有
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.25,1:15:07.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就飞到哥伦比亚再降落
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.17,1:15:09.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,去看看能不能手动收回来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.96,1:15:13.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉造成你的不便 无需担心
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.09,1:15:21.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 航班取消了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.21,1:15:24.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,很抱歉通知你 你已经被取消了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.96,1:15:28.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,请坐
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.63,1:15:31.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,放松
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.42,1:15:34.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,喝点酒 我们彼此好好认识一下
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.63,1:15:38.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我需要知道的都知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.96,1:17:26.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.30,1:19:11.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,答对得五分 什么东西 有眼睛却没耳朵 有皮肤却没头发
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.96,1:19:14.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,里面白色 外面棕色
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.13,1:19:16.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 妈? - 虫子吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.13,1:19:19.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 错 爸? - 毛毛虫
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.05,1:19:22.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 错 - 马铃薯
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.92,1:19:30.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 可以帮你吗? - 我正要离开
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.55,1:19:35.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 椰子 - 错
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.71,1:19:39.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 蛇 - 错
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.50,1:19:42.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 花生 - 不对!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.88,1:19:45.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 热狗 - 错
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.05,1:20:00.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好快 - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.50,1:20:07.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不希望你错过班机嘛 - 你真是体贴
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.88,1:20:17.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,看一看 伙伴
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.59,1:20:23.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们不会相信我昨晚 经历了什么样的事
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.09,1:20:32.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有东西要送你 因为你海滩没去成
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.71,1:20:38.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道的 水就是水 沙就是沙 这儿那儿还不都一样
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.25,1:20:40.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞往巴黎编号069班机
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.50,1:20:43.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 法兰克 真是有趣的假期
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.67,1:20:47.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 还能奢求什么呢? - 是呀
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.96,1:20:51.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 再见了 法兰克 - 再见了 朋友 祝你一路顺风
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.88,1:20:54.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很怀疑 听说全程是逆风
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.55,1:20:58.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我猜我们无法事事如意 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.13,1:21:01.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 我们不行
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.25,1:21:17.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.63,1:21:20.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在找一位送货人
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.96,1:21:25.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,请说
